157:cd ToolBench
163:or for ToolEval only
165:pip install -r toolbench/tooleval/requirements.txt
168:Prepare the data and tool environment:
174:### Training Retriever
178:python preprocess/preprocess_retriever_data.py \
182:    --output_dir data/retrieval/G1
184:- Then run the following command to train the tool retriever:
187:python toolbench/retrieval/train.py \
188:    --data_path data/retrieval/G1/ \
190:    --output_path retrieval_model \
198:### Training ToolLLaMA
202:python preprocess/preprocess_toolllama_data.py \
203:    --tool_data_dir data/answer/G1_answer \
