207:- Our training code is based on [FastChat](https://github.com/lm-sys/FastChat). You can use the following command to train ToolLLaMA-7b with 2 x A100 (80GB), with our preprocessed data `data/toolllama_G123_dfs_train.json`. For preprocessing details, we split the G1, G2 and G3 data into train, eval and test parts respectively and combine the train data for training in our main experiments:
210:torchrun --nproc_per_node=2 --master_port=20001 toolbench/train/train_mem.py \
212:    --data_path  data/toolllama_G123_dfs_train.json \
213:    --eval_data_path  data/toolllama_G123_dfs_eval.json \
214:    --conv_template tool-llama-single-round \
216:    --output_dir toolllama \
