246:    --eval_data_path  data/toolllama_G123_dfs_eval.json \
247:    --conv_template tool-llama-single-round \
249:    --output_dir toolllama_lora \
272:## Inference With Our RapidAPI Server
273:Please fill out the [form](https://forms.gle/S4hqVLtnqeXcNTCJA) first and after reviewing we will send you the toolbench key. Then prepare your toolbench key by:
275:export TOOLBENCH_KEY="your_toolbench_key"
278:### For ToolLLaMA
280:To inference with ToolLLaMA, run the following commands:
