ver:text-gray-300">OpenAI Compatible API</a><ul class=""><li class="toc-item relative border-l pl-4 border-gray-950/5 dark:border-white/10 hover:border-gray-950/20 dark:hover:border-white/20" data-depth="1"><a style="padding-left:1rem" href="#launching-the-server" class="group flex items-start break-words py-1 whitespace-pre-wrap text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400 dark:hover:text-gray-300">Launching the Server</a></li><li class="toc-item relative border-l pl-4 border-gray-950/5 dark:border-white/10 hover:border-gray-950/20 dark:hover:border-white/20" data-depth="1"><a style="padding-left:1rem" href="#define-tools-for-function-call" class="group flex items-start break-words py-1 whitespace-pre-wrap text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400 dark:hover:text-gray-300">Define Tools for Function Call</a></li><li class="toc-item relative border-l pl-4 border-gray-950/5 dark:border-white/10 hover:border-gray-950/20 dark:hover:border-white/20" data-depth="1"><a style="padding-left:1rem" href="#define-messages" class="group flex items-start break-words py-1 whitespace-pre-wrap text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400 dark:hover:text-gray-300">Define Messages</a></li><li class="toc-item relative border-l pl-4 border-gray-950/5 dark:border-white/10 hover:border-gray-950/20 dark:hover:border-white/20" data-depth="1"><a style="padding-left:1rem" href="#initialize-the-client" class="group flex items-start break-words py-1 whitespace-pre-wrap text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400 dark:hover:text-gray-300">Initialize the Client</a></li><li class="toc-item relative border-l pl-4 border-gray-950/5 dark:border-white/10 hover:border-gray-950/20 dark:hover:border-white/20" data-depth="1"><a style="padding-left:1rem" href="#non-streaming-request" class="group flex items-start break-words py-1 whitespace-pre-wrap text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400 dark:hover:text-gray-300">Non-Streaming Request</a></li><li class="toc-item relative border-l pl-4 border-gray-950/5 dark:border-white/10 hover:border-gray-950/20 dark:hover:border-white/20" data-depth="2"><a style="padding-left:2rem" href="#handle-tools" class="group flex items-start break-words py-1 whitespace-pre-wrap text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400 dark:hover:text-gray-300">Handle Tools</a></li><li class="toc-item relative border-l pl-4 border-gray-950/5 dark:border-white/10 hover:border-gray-950/20 dark:hover:border-white/20" data-depth="1"><a style="padding-left:1rem" href="#streaming-request" class="group flex items-start break-words py-1 whitespace-pre-wrap text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400 dark:hover:text-gray-300">Streaming Request</a></li><li class="toc-item relative border-l pl-4 border-gray-950/5 dark:border-white/10 hover:border-gray-950/20 dark:hover:border-white/20" data-depth="2"><a style="padding-left:2rem" href="#handle-tools-2" class="group flex items-start break-words py-1 whitespace-pre-wrap text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400 dark:hover:text-gray-300">Handle Tools</a></li><li class="toc-item relative border-l pl-4 border-gray-950/5 dark:border-white/10 hover:border-gray-950/20 dark:hover:border-white/20" data-depth="1"><a style="padding-left:1rem" href="#define-a-tool-function" class="group flex items-start break-words py-1 whitespace-pre-wrap text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400 dark:hover:text-gray-300">Define a Tool Function</a></li><li class="toc-item relative border-l pl-4 border-gray-950/5 dark:border-white/10 hover:border-gray-950/20 dark:hover:border-white/20" data-depth="1"><a style="padding-left:1rem" href="#execute-the-tool" class="group flex items-start break-words py-1 whitespace-pre-wrap text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400 dark:hover:text-gray-300">Execute the Tool</a></li><li class="toc-item relative border-l pl-4 border-gray-950/5 dark:border-white/10 hover:border-gray-950/20 dark:hover:border-white/20" data-depth="1"><a style="padding-left:1rem" href="#send-results-back-to-model" class="group flex items-start break-words py-1 whitespace-pre-wrap text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400 dark:hover:text-gray-300">Send Results Back to Model</a></li></ul></li><li class="toc-item relative" data-depth="0"><a href="#native-api-and-sglang-runtime-srt" class="break-words py-1 block font-medium border-l pl-4 border-gray-950/5 dark:border-white/10 hover:border-gray-950/20 dark:hover:border-white/20 hover:text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400 dark:hover:text-gray-300">Native API and SGLang Runtime (SRT)</a></li><li class="toc-item relative" data-depth="0"><a href="#offline-engine-api" class="break-words py-1 block font-medium border-l pl-4 border-gray-950/5 dark:border-white/10 hover:border-gray-950/20 dark:hover:border-white/20 hover:text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400 dark:hover:text-gray-300">Offline Engine API</a></li><li class="toc-item relative" data-depth="0"><a href="#tool-choice-mode" class="break-words py-1 block font-medium border-l pl-4 border-gray-950/5 dark:border-white/10 hover:border-gray-950/20 dark:hover:border-white/20 hover:text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400 dark:hover:text-gray-300">Tool Choice Mode</a><ul class=""><li class="toc-item relative border-l pl-4 border-gray-950/5 dark:border-white/10 hover:border-gray-950/20 dark:hover:border-white/20" data-depth="1"><a style="padding-left:1rem" href="#supported-tool-choice-options" class="group flex items-start break-words py-1 whitespace-pre-wrap text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400 dark:hover:text-gray-300">Supported Tool Choice Options</a></li><li class="toc-item relative border-l pl-4 border-gray-950/5 dark:border-white/10 hover:border-gray-950/20 dark:hover:border-white/20" data-depth="1"><a style="padding-left:1rem" href="#backend-compatibility" class="group flex items-start break-words py-1 whitespace-pre-wrap text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400 dark:hover:text-gray-300">Backend Compatibility</a></li><li class="toc-item relative border-l pl-4 border-gray-950/5 dark:border-white/10 hover:border-gray-950/20 dark:hover:border-white/20" data-depth="1"><a style="padding-left:1rem" href="#example-required-tool-choice" class="group flex items-start break-words py-1 whitespace-pre-wrap text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400 dark:hover:text-gray-300">Example: Required Tool Choice</a></li><li class="toc-item relative border-l pl-4 border-gray-950/5 dark:border-white/10 hover:border-gray-950/20 dark:hover:border-white/20" data-depth="1"><a style="padding-left:1rem" href="#example-specific-function-choice" class="group flex items-start break-words py-1 whitespace-pre-wrap text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400 dark:hover:text-gray-300">Example: Specific Function Choice</a></li></ul></li><li class="toc-item relative" data-depth="0"><a href="#pythonic-tool-call-format-llama-3-2-%2F-llama-3-3-%2F-llama-4" class="break-words py-1 block font-medium border-l pl-4 border-gray-950/5 dark:border-white/10 hover:border-gray-950/20 dark:hover:border-white/20 hover:text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400 dark:hover:text-gray-300">Pythonic Tool Call Format (Llama-3.2 / Llama-3.3 / Llama-4)</a><ul class=""><li class="toc-item relative border-l pl-4 border-gray-950/5 dark:border-white/10 hover:border-gray-950/20 dark:hover:border-white/20" data-depth="1"><a style="padding-left:1rem" href="#how-to-enable" class="group flex items-start break-words py-1 whitespace-pre-wrap text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400 dark:hover:text-gray-300">How to enable</a></li><li class="toc-item relative border-l pl-4 border-gray-950/5 dark:border-white/10 hover:border-gray-950/20 dark:hover:border-white/20" data-depth="2"><a style="padding-left:2rem" href="#forcing-pythonic-tool-call-output-without-a-chat-template" class="group flex items-start break-words py-1 whitespace-pre-wrap text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400 dark:hover:text-gray-300">Forcing Pythonic Tool Call Output Without a Chat Template</a></li></ul></li><li class="toc-item relative" data-depth="0"><a href="#how-to-support-a-new-model" class="break-words py-1 block font-medium border-l pl-4 border-gray-950/5 dark:border-white/10 hover:border-gray-950/20 dark:hover:border-white/20 hover:text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400 dark:hover:text-gray-300">How to support a new model?</a></li></ul></div></nav></div></div></div><div class="grow w-full mx-auto [contain:inline-size] xl:w-[calc(100%-28rem)]" id="content-area"><header id="header" class="relative leading-none @container/page-header"><div class="mt-0.5 space-y-2.5"><div class="eyebrow h-5 text-primary dark:text-primary-light text-sm font-semibold">Advanced Features</div><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center relative gap-2 min-w-0"><h1 id="page-title" class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-gray-900 tracking-tight dark:text-gray-200 [overflow-wrap:anywhere] font-bold">Tool Parser</h1><div id="page-context-menu" class="items-center shrink-0 min-w-[156px] justify-end ml-auto hidden @[600px]/page-header:flex"><button id="page-context-menu-button" class="rounded-l-xl px-3 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 py-1.5 border border-gray-200 dark:border-white/[0.07] bg-background-light dark:bg-background-dark hover:bg-gray-600/5 dark:hover:bg-gray-200/5 border-r-0" aria-label="Copy page"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-center font-medium"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="size-4"><path d="M14.25 5.25H7.25C6.14543 5.25 5.25 6.14543 5.25 7.25V14.25C5.25 15.3546 6.14543 16.25 7.25 16.25H14.25C15.3546 16.25 16.25 15.3546 16.25 14.25V7.25C16.25 6.14543 15.3546 5.25 14.25 5.25Z" stroke="currentColor" width="1.5" linecap="round" linejoin="round"></path><path d="M2.80103 11.998L1.77203 5.07397C1.61003 3.98097 2.